1
00:00:00,913 --> 00:00:02,883
(Raj:)under those pretty
rubber gloves?

2
00:00:04,317 --> 00:00:06,547
(Isabella:)No, not for many years.

3
00:00:06,552 --> 00:00:09,182
(Raj:)Oh, so, you are unencumbered?

4
00:00:09,188 --> 00:00:10,218
(Isabella:)Just me and my son.

5
00:00:10,223 --> 00:00:12,123
(Raj:)I love kids,
how old is he?

6
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:14,295
(Isabella:)Nineteen.

7
00:00:15,428 --> 00:00:18,328
(Raj:)That's a cute age.

8
00:00:18,331 --> 00:00:21,031
(Raj:)They can do so many things.

9
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,733
(Isabella:)He's studying to be

10
00:00:22,735 --> 00:00:24,465
(Isabella:)a lawyer at UCLA.

11
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:25,670
(Raj:)That's wonderful.

12
00:00:25,671 --> 00:00:27,841
(Raj:)A lawyer, my sister's a lawyer.

13
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,870
(Bernadette:)Look at that,
we have something in common.

14
00:00:29,876 --> 00:00:31,676
(Isabella:)Yeah, I guess we do.

15
00:00:31,677 --> 00:00:34,847
(Raj:)Maybe there are other things
we have in common.

16
00:00:34,847 --> 00:00:38,787
C-Come dinnertime,
do you enjoy eating food?

17
00:00:38,785 --> 00:00:41,485
Ay, Rajesh,

18
00:00:41,487 --> 00:00:43,787
(Isabella:)I think you're very sweet,
but

19
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,990
(Isabella:)I work two jobs and I don't
have time for dating.

20
00:00:46,993 --> 00:00:48,823
(Raj:)Yeah, sure. I understand.

21
00:00:48,828 --> 00:00:50,398
(Raj:)Yeah, I'm very busy, too.

22
00:00:50,396 --> 00:00:52,166
(Isabella:)Oh, please don't take it
personal,

23
00:00:52,165 --> 00:00:53,995
(Isabella:)I think you're a very nice man.

24
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,770
(Raj:)I think you're very nice
as well.

25
00:00:56,769 --> 00:00:58,639
(Isabella:)Thank you for helping me.

26
00:00:58,638 --> 00:01:00,238
(Isabella:)Good night, Rajesh.

